.DS_Store
*.log
.env
.env.local
.agent-forge/local/
.claude/worktrees/
# Rendered projection (derived from packages/agent-canon/ideas via resolve.py; regenerable).
# A projection is NOT a deployment (projection-is-not-the-source): the render goes to a
# NEUTRAL staging dir that Claude Code does NOT auto-load -- deliberately NOT a
# `<repo>/.claude/{agents,skills}` tree, since a project-scoped session would load that
# AS a de-facto deployment merely because it was rendered. Scope is an accident applied
# at deploy time (deploy.py --scope ...), never a render side effect. The real deploy
# target is user-scope ~/.claude per host (C4); a `<repo>/.claude/{agents,skills}` tree
# may exist ONLY as an explicit `deploy.py --scope project` opt-in by a downstream adopter.
packages/agent-canon/.render/
# The standalone TS projection (resolve.py's TS counterpart, src/toolkit/project-cli.ts).
# Same neutral-staging rationale as .render/ above; regenerable, never a deploy.
packages/agent-canon/.render-ts/
# The codex-harness projection (project-cli-codex.ts) — proof that agent-canon reaches a
# second agent-forge harness for free. Same neutral-staging
# rationale; kept separate so the claude byte-identity diff stays clean.
packages/agent-canon/.render-ts-codex/
# Fleet deploy topology carries env-specific SSH usernames — local-only.
# Committed template: .agent-factory.config.example. Schema: docs/agent-factory-config-schema.md
.agent-factory.config
!.agent-factory.config.example
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.scratchpad/
# Agent memory stores are per-agent home state — never repo-tracked (raw EPISODIC capture is agent-home only).
EPISODIC.jsonl
MEMORY.md
SELF.md
# graphify knowledge-graph. Track ONLY graph.json — the single file with explicit track-intent
# (.gitattributes merge=graphify; a merge driver is meaningless for an ignored file). Everything else
# under graphify-out/ is regenerable from it or ephemeral (GRAPH_REPORT.md, graph.html, cost.json,
# manifest.json, the .graphify_* working index, cache/) — rebuilt by `graphify update`, kept out of git
# to avoid churn/bloat. packages/graphify-out/ is a stray second graph (root resolved to packages/).
graphify-out/*
!graphify-out/graph.json
packages/graphify-out/
